{
  "esm": "2.1.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "sectional_lr2m_slope",
    "description": "Slope b of the linear number density of section j on its support [lo, hi] (sectional_lr2m_support_bottom / _top), in the normalised coordinate z = (v - lo)/(hi - lo): n(z) = N (a + b z)/(hi - lo) with a = 1 - b/2, so that the density integrates to N, and b = 12 ((vbar - lo)/(hi - lo) - 1/2), so that its first moment is the section volume V = N vbar. On the full section (lo, hi) = (vb[j], vb[j+1]) the normalised mean is the position x itself (sectional_lr2m_position), so b = 12 (x - 1/2); on a cut-back support the normalised mean is exactly 1/3 (the lower-third triangle, b = -2, vanishing at its top) or 2/3 (the upper-third triangle, b = +2, vanishing at its bottom). The slope is written by branch so that it reads the position once and the supports not at all. MOSAIC's dumbb.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:stencil",
      "family:finite_volume",
      "grid:sectional_volume_1d",
      "op:advection",
      "order:2",
      "scheme:linear-discrete"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Zaveri, R. A., Easter, R. C., Fast, J. D., & Peters, L. K. (2008). Model for Simulating Aerosol Interactions and Chemistry (MOSAIC). Journal of Geophysical Research, 113, D13204.",
        "doi": "10.1029/2007JD008782"
      },
      {
        "citation": "WRF-Chem v4.8.0 chem/module_mosaic_movesect.F, subroutines move_sections_calc_masnumadvect and move_sections_apply_moves (R. C. Easter), the 'linear-discrete' / mass-number-advection section-moving algorithm (msectional = 20)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    {
      "ref": "./sectional_lr2m_position.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "./sectional_lr2m_low_triangle.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "./sectional_lr2m_high_triangle.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "../grid.esm"
    }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "sectional_lr2m_slope": {
      "params": ["N", "V", "c", "j"],
      "body": {
        "op": "ifelse",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "sectional_lr2m_low_triangle",
            "bindings": {"N": "N", "V": "V", "c": "c", "j": "j"}
          },
          -2,
          {
            "op": "ifelse",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "sectional_lr2m_high_triangle",
                "bindings": {"N": "N", "V": "V", "c": "c", "j": "j"}
              },
              2,
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  12,
                  {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "apply_expression_template",
                        "args": [],
                        "name": "sectional_lr2m_position",
                        "bindings": {"N": "N", "V": "V", "c": "c", "j": "j"}
                      },
                      {"op": "/", "args": [1, 2]}
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
